5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the depot floor! The equipment there is old, and freight never stops. We need a system that survives our real calendar.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’m concerned about the hidden costs. The headline price is a lie; the real bill arrives after the contract is signed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know who actually owns the system when it fails. Ambiguity in support is a structural risk I refuse to ignore.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I’m curious about the past! I want to see why old systems break and why outside work needs fixing. Let’s check the history!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the people. The ones holding this together are stretched thin. How will this change land on their weary shoulders?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, hidden costs scare me too! But if the yard devices crash during peak season, we lose everything. Let’s check the depot calendar and the yard devices!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, the calendar is just the stage. I need to see the actual money trail. I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital requests.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, invoices show what was paid, not who answered the phone. I will examine support ownership during last winter's outage and the administrator retirements and hiring times.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree! I want to see the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move. Let’s find the ghosts!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your focus on support is vital. I will examine administrator retirements and hiring times, plus depot supervisors and the last rollout, to see who remains.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the dispatch tool history is key! If it broke before, it’ll break again. I’ll check the yard devices and the depot calendar to see if we’re ready.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
